WEBVTT

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.900
Where is she!?

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.950
No running in the hallways!

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.120
Hey, did you see a witch around here?

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:20.120
A witch?

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.630
If you haven't, then never mind.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.370
I said, no running...

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:30.300
<i>I have to hurry and find the witch to cancel the effect of the fake Gift!</i>

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.540
<i>If I don't, I...</i>

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:36.450
Coming!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.260
Kirino-chan!

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:45.340
What's wrong?

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.070
There's something...

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.820
...I have to talk to you about.

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:10.190
These feelings that I couldn't even tell my friends about

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:15.520
are still locked up inside me even now

00:01:16.690 --> 00:01:20.610
If I eat the magical fruit inside my heart

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:25.580
they might actually be able to come out

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:31.190
I kept on waiting in the classroom

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:36.190
making excuses that it's just a coincidence

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:41.780
That smile is probably meant for someone

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:47.240
If dreams can make my wishes come true

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:52.190
I want to give you this present

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:57.360
I will transform your rainbow

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:02.320
into a bridge of happiness, just wave to me

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:07.600
It's all right, it's all right

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:12.950
I simply want to watch over you...

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:31.130
<i>The Meaning of Happiness</i>

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.830
No way! You met the witch?

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.620
Thanks to her, I'm fully fluent in English now.

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:33.810
Now Kathy will be mine.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:34.830
Hey!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:37.420
Where did you meet the witch?

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:39.680
In the courtyard...

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:40.740
Thanks!

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.760
That was the day before yesterday, though...

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:48.100
Dunno, haven't seen her.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:52.140
Though I have been confessed to by some freshman...

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.240
...who got himself a make-over from a fake Gift in order to meet my standards.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.180
What was his name?

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:02.280
All I know is that he was a librarian.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:06.740
I have no interest in men utilising forgeries.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:09.530
If you want to associate with me...

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:10.960
Huh?

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.710
H-Hey, where did you go!?

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:16.250
He's not here?

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:21.110
Then at least tell me his name and class!

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:26.680
Are you listening?

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.590
That boy transferred out.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:33.980
After he turned into a pretty boy, he was scouted out to become a model.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.130
Damn it...

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:37.620
There goes my lead...

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.570
Do you have a wish for the witch?

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:41.900
Yeah...

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:45.710
She's granted one of my wishes as well.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:48.330
She brought back my dog that had gotten lost.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.710
Where did you meet her!?

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.550
Err...

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:54.210
Behind the station...

00:03:55.690 --> 00:04:00.110
Damn, she's been throwing around fake Gifts like crazy!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.620
Damn...

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:03.430
Yes?

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:08.180
Are you still conducting your primitive and futile investigation?

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.360
You look like you're running the Narasaki marathon.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.770
If you have nothing useful to say, I'm hanging up!

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:17.870
The witch is currently...

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:21.360
...flying eastward at an estimated altitude of three hundred meters.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.530
How do you know?

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:27.530
My fixed-point observational radar just happened to come in handy.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.290
Fixed-point observation?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.420
Science doesn't need reasons.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:33.700
And one more thing.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.820
I have something to offer you.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:44.410
Pursuit unit Mr. Fidget!

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:47.630
Steering is done by shifting your weight, making for easy movement...

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.460
...and it comes equipped with a communication device.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.350
However...

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.120
Whatever!

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.520
Anyway, I'm borrowing it!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.340
<i>Just wait, Riko!</i>

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.610
...it is not possible to stop its movement yet, though.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:10.370
Don't prepare something like that!!!

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.780
I'm sorry...

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.080
It's my fault that...

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.420
...Haruhiko-kun is...

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.820
I'm sorry.

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:25.720
I'm really sorry!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.820
I'm sorry...

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:30.720
...our promise...

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:36.570
<i>I...</i>

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:39.600
<i>...can't blame you for anything.</i>

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:46.900
Hey Amami, do you have a minute?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.280
Straight ahead of you...

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.370
...there is a pond.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.650
Say that a little sooner!!!

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:08.290
What do you think of my machine?

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:11.390
Its performance is tuned to the physical limits!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:14.150
Don't make any unneeded improvements!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.250
There she is!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.220
Hey!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.690
Wait!!!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:26.990
Wait!

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.320
Come on!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:31.720
No way! How is that possible!?

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:33.190
Don't you say that!

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.740
No!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:35.450
Hey!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:38.540
Sorry to barge in!

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:41.250
Excuse me!

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:52.220
Geez! Why are you chasing me!?

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.880
I have something to talk to you about!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.490
Please, listen to me...

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:56.470
Watch out!

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.320
Are you okay?

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:10.040
Please turn me back to normal!

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:11.710
Please!

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:13.880
Turn me back to normal!

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.440
Oh, you have a wish?

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:18.370
Then you should've said so sooner!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.960
I want you to cancel the fake Gift you gave to Kirino!

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.040
Cancel it?

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.010
You gave it to her in the music room at school the day before yesterday, didn't you?

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:29.300
I certainly gave it to her...

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.590
...but what about it?

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:36.100
It has affected me.

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:41.380
The girl I like is looking like a different person.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.430
I beg of you.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:45.440
Turn me back to normal!

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:48.290
I'm sorry.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.440
I can't.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.800
Why not!?

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:53.880
My magic...

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:55.860
The fake Gifts...

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:00.330
It's not possible to cancel them individually.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.070
No way...

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:04.330
That can't be...

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.680
I'm sorry!

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:07.000
Wait!

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:10.650
Please wait!

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:11.900
I'm not done yet!

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:12.860
No!

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.090
Let go!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.560
Hey, you okay?

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:26.970
Ouch...

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.890
W-Why...

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:32.960
...are you...

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:36.670
You're the witch!

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:39.530
Looks like my cover's blown!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.100
You've been giving away fake Gifts?

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:51.470
I received this power from my mother.

00:08:58.310 --> 00:09:03.630
Ever since I was little, I've been doing everything my mother told me to do.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:07.490
I believed that was happiness.

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:14.650
However, one day...

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:17.670
...I started questioning whether this was really okay.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:26.030
But, I knew my mother cared about me, so...

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:30.380
...I figured it was fine how it was, and that I would attain happiness this way.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:33.620
However...

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:36.880
An arranged marriage?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.040
Yes.

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:41.890
I am sure this person will make you happy.

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:45.010
Really?

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:52.630
If I keep doing everything you say, will I really be happy in the end?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.820
Chisa!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.660
Is happiness really something one can simply receive?

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.080
I can give it to you.

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.510
Want to make sure?

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:08.750
With your own two hands.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.740
Gift.

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:31.190
After that, I dressed up as a witch and gave away fake Gifts to numerous people.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.410
But...

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:34.230
They're still fakes, right?

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:37.490
Something like that can't make anyone truly happy!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:38.530
Amami-kun...

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:41.830
Gift is...

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:46.540
...something much... much more precious.

00:10:47.570 --> 00:10:49.650
To the point that it can even give life.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.350
Chisa!

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:55.210
Please return that power to your mother!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:58.340
If you do that, the effect of the fake Gifts will disappear.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.510
I'm sorry.

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:03.640
Why not!?

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:04.640
Because...!

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:06.570
Because...

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:11.420
...there are so many people I've made happy through the fake Gifts!

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:16.660
I can't just take all those people's happiness away...

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.880
It was just like Mother said!

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:26.290
Happiness can be easily attained.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.500
<i>Narasaki Shopping District</i>

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.730
You're a pretty lady!

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:34.340
I'll give you an extra croquette for free!

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:38.440
Good day, Amami-san!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.050
Are you on your way home?

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.330
I see...

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.970
You knew about Chisa...

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:54.330
Yes.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:56.070
Somehow.

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.320
I wonder if she's really okay with this...

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:04.370
Happiness can be easily attained.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.950
I think she is still confused.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.240
I figure she is.

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:12.120
She has always obeyed her parents' every whim.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.730
That is not really the way to put it...

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:18.630
Chisa-san loves her mother very much.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.620
Of course, her mother loves her as well.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.170
That is why...

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:26.460
...I think it will be fine no matter the path she chooses.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.140
As long as she is happy along the way.

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:32.890
Is that really so?

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:36.900
To tell you the truth, I have no memories.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.940
I have amnesia.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.900
With amnesia, you mean... that?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:46.650
Yes, that.

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:49.410
Did I surprise you?

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.910
Very much.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.620
You didn't look that way at all.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.380
I think that is because I am happy right now.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:02.690
Did I have a wonderful life in the past?

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:04.700
Or was I miserable instead?

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.140
I have no way of knowing that.

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:09.960
However, right now...

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:18.270
...I feel very blessed to be supported by Chisa-san, her parents, Jinta-san and my many friends.

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:21.940
I am sure the people who knew me in the past...

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:27.600
...are praying for me to live a blissful life as well.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.820
What is important...

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.510
...is not the past, but the future.

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:52.020
<i>What's important is not the past, but the future, huh?</i>

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.490
All right!

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:02.530
If I can't solve this through the witch, I need to stay positive and look for other ways.

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:07.740
Fake or not, it is still related to the Gift.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.970
I'll ask Tama-nee about it first.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.090
That's right...

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:23.710
She mentioned the fake Gift was invoked that evening.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.030
That means...

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:27.930
It was my fault?

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:30.360
Because I...

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:31.980
...saw my mother in Riko...?

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.190
Onii-chan? You're back, aren't you?

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.180
Dinner is ready.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:47.780
Hey now!

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:51.680
Just who are you mistaking your cute little sister for?

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:54.520
H-How did you...?

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:09.050
I heard from Kirino-chan.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:11.930
I see...

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.970
Cheer up!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:18.270
It's not like it's your fault.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:28.030
Just don't blame Kirino-chan for this, okay?

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:34.200
I can't blame her.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:41.600
It's all... my fault.

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:44.560
Still caught up in the past...

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.390
...and putting the blame on someone else...

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.630
I truly am the worst kind of fool.

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:54.470
I can't even tell what expression you're making right now.

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:57.670
Onii-chan...

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:05.480
Haruhiko-kun?

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:07.930
Please take me to Chisa's house right now.

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.360
Right now?

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.200
Yeah.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.240
I'm going to see the witch.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:17.990
What did you want to talk about?

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.920
Of course, it's about the fake Gifts, right?

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.130
I want one as well.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.380
A fake Gift.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:33.010
You do?

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.290
Yeah.

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:35.400
Why...?

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:39.720
In order to erase that over there.

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:41.650
Why!?

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:44.380
That rainbow symbolizes the Gift!

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:47.360
Haruhiko-kun, the Gift was so precious to you...!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:48.400
Riko...

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:51.950
I'm seeing my mother in Riko.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:56.610
It's probably because I've never been able to let go of her.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:59.660
I think that's why it's come to this.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:01.450
But...

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.450
...the person before me is not my mother.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.220
It's Riko!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:12.760
A good cook, humble to anyone, haughty at home and packing a powerful chop.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.780
My little sister.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:15.800
Onii-chan...

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:19.480
I...

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.730
...can't live under these conditions.

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.530
I don't want to!

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:26.560
I want to see you the way you are!

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:31.350
If I can't return the fake Gift back to normal...

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:33.080
...I'll just have to cut off the root of the problem.

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:36.740
I'll erase the rainbow Mother loved...

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.570
...and erase my memories of her with it.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:39.620
Are you sure?

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:40.530
Very sure!

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:43.000
What I want to protect right now is Riko!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:48.580
What's important is not the past, but the future.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:49.990
Come on, Chisa!

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:57.210
You won't... regret it?

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.370
I decided this myself.

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:01.470
I won't regret it.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.580
I'm sorry!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:14.570
Hey, wait!

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.410
I'm sorry, Amami-kun.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:21.450
I can't give you a fake Gift.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:25.160
I'll return this power to my mother.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.430
But, if you do that...

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.560
The happiness I gave to all those people might disappear as well.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:34.840
Are you okay with that?

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.360
It's fine!

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:40.330
You can't attain happiness that easily after all.

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:43.970
Seeing you made me realize that.

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:44.940
Me?

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:56.010
Mother, thank you for everything.

00:18:56.490 --> 00:19:01.570
But I think I have to walk on my own strength after all.

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:08.780
Chisa.

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.380
I understand.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.560
Thank you...

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:28.630
...Mother.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.850
Hey, Kirino!

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:51.460
There's no need to condemn yourself anymore, is there?

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:52.750
That's right!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.300
But now that everything's back to normal...

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.680
...it'll be tiring to have to see this face again every day.

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:02.990
Hey!

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:04.720
I can't let that comment slide!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.720
At least cosplay for me?

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:08.930
Why would I!?

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.530
Then what would you want me to cosplay as?

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:11.970
- Let's see...

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:12.940
Say it if you dare!

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:13.620
- An executioner would suit you!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.410
C'mon, let's hurry home!

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:20.190
Kirino-chan, you say something to him too!

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:23.580
Come back here!

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.220
Well, everyone...

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:33.960
...I take it all of you have received the guidebook for our school trip?

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.090
Yes!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:40.460
You are free to choose what to do on free-roaming days yourselves.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.850
Incidentally, my recommendation would be...

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:46.370
...a certain shrine which is famous for its fulfillment of love.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:50.890
The kindergarten next to it, actually.

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:52.390
It is very nice.

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:57.060
The sight of innocent angels skipping about in the early summer sunshine...

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.080
It is truly heaven!

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.450
What did you want to talk about?

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:14.190
The destination for your school trip has been decided, huh?

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:17.380
Ah, you want a souvenir?

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.270
Leave it to me!

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:22.130
I'll buy you a rockin' Kyoto souvenir.

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:25.130
There is something specific I want.

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:30.500
There's a shrine that is famed to be able to fulfill one's love.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:31.640
Do you know about it?

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.600
We just heard about it...

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:37.570
I want a charm from that shrine.

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:40.980
One from you, to me!

00:22:12.170 --> 00:22:16.350
In a corner of the classroom

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:22.940
I hummed my favourite song

00:22:23.760 --> 00:22:28.870
Why did those melancholic feelings

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:33.100
well up within me today

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:40.140
When I return, will this town

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:43.930
gently welcome me back?

00:22:43.930 --> 00:22:48.120
Hey, I want to meet you

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:55.240
In times you feel down, I wish you would tell me

00:22:55.240 --> 00:23:00.160
before you can no longer turn back

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:04.110
Building a heartfelt rainbow together

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:06.920
Say that I'm not alone

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:12.990
So that my prayers may be heard

00:23:30.520 --> 00:23:33.030
Everyone, we're going on a school trip.

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:36.650
A trip to broaden your horizons and enrich your life.

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:38.180
That is, meeting innocent angels...

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:41.470
...their lovely antics, their sweet smiles, their ambrosial youth!

00:23:41.470 --> 00:23:43.550
I have to see all this for myself!

00:23:43.550 --> 00:23:44.520
This is my supreme mission.

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:46.080
The greatest bliss in life!

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:49.110
Oh God, please show me the path!

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:51.920
If anyone is interested, please drop by the staff room later.

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:59.960
<i>Time of Memories</i>

00:23:52.380 --> 00:23:54.800
Next time, "Time of Memories."

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:59.190
Gift. Of course, I will give it to one of my pure angels...
